  "definition": "Extension of Continuing Education Deadlines",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-05-18",
  "historyNote": "#9018, eff 11-1-07; ss by #10270, eff 2-2-13 (from Rab 403.04), EXPIRED: 2-2-23 New. #13968, eff 5-18-24",
